  "subtitle": "Glazed salmon with a sweet soy marinade",
  "excerpt": "Salmon fillets marinated in soy, mirin, and honey, then fried until the glaze caramelises. The marinade doubles as a basting sauce in the pan. Ready in under 20 minutes once the fish has had a short soak.",
